window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Now Available in Duet Narration!</b></p> <p>Experience Fortune Fae Academy with immersive duet performance, where every character’s dialogue is brought vividly to life by dedicated narrators.</p> <p><b>She never asked to be claimed by fate.</b></p> <p>I was born with the gift of sight—I can see the future. But I never saw this coming.</p> <p>Dragged to Fortune Fae Academy, I’m thrown into a world of dangerous magic, ruthless rivals, and mysterious protectors who circle closer with every secret I uncover. They believe I’m strong enough to survive... and maybe they’re right.</p> <p>What they don’t know is that I refuse to be controlled. I’ll keep running until destiny itself proves me wrong.</p> <p><b>Welcome to Fortune Fae Academy</b></p> <p>Book 1 in a romantasy academy series filled with magic, danger, and slow-burn tension. Perfect for fans of <i>romantic fantasy with multiple love interests, fierce heroines, and high-stakes adventure</i>.</p> <p><i>Author’s Note: This series contains morally gray heroes, intense romantic tension, and ends on a cliffhanger.</i></p>"; 
